1
00:00:00,224 --> 00:00:01,824
Good morning, Peter.

2
00:00:02,576 --> 00:00:04,464
Good morning, Ms Gao.

3
00:00:05,536 --> 00:00:07,792
What classes do you have today?

4
00:00:09,136 --> 00:00:11,936
I have Chinese and maths first.

5
00:00:12,992 --> 00:00:14,704
Do you like those subjects?

6
00:00:15,488 --> 00:00:18,016
I like Chinese because it’s fun,

7
00:00:18,256 --> 00:00:20,496
but I don’t like maths.

8
00:00:21,296 --> 00:00:22,112
Why?

9
00:00:22,784 --> 00:00:25,392
Because maths is boring to me.

10
00:00:26,032 --> 00:00:29,072
But every subject is important.

11
00:00:29,888 --> 00:00:32,144
What other classes do you have today?

12
00:00:32,672 --> 00:00:34,640
IT and PE.

13
00:00:35,024 --> 00:00:36,848
What’s your favourite class?

14
00:00:37,472 --> 00:00:40,160
PE, because it’s exciting.

